#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:1 1fe86ca90e2a48c4990826c62dcac01d
msgid "Network Protocols"
msgstr "网络协议"

#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:3 7849fa090b8340edb17f2686723ed9de
msgid "Data Messages and Control Messages"
msgstr "数据报文和控制报文"

#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:5 4ed54f5e189341b39c26a2619bc6cae6
msgid ""
"There are two types of messages transferred among the cluster nodes: "
"data messages and control messages. Data messages contains encoded "
"tuples delivered by the \"send operators\", including \"FIN\". Control "
"messages are used to coordinate the job running. The following is the "
"control message types currently implemented"
msgstr ""
"集群节点之间传输两种类型的信息：数据信息和控制信息。数据信息包含由 \"发送"
"操作员\"（包括 \"FIN\"）发送的编码元组。控制信息用于协调作业运行。目前实"
"现的控制信息类型如下"

#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:9 b2388249d33943b3b5612a32d0bc06f2
msgid ""
"Task delivery message: tasks are serialized and delivered from the "
"coordinator to executors."
msgstr "任务交付消息：任务被序列化并从协调器交付给执行器。"

#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:10 0f664fe0e66c46a19565ceed244a30b6
msgid ""
"Receiving ready message: the \"receive operators\" send messages to the "
"corresponding \"send operators\" to notify that they are properly "
"started and ready to receive data messages."
msgstr ""
"接收就绪信息：\"接收操作符 \"向相应的 \"发送操作符 \"发送信息，通知它们已"
"正确启动并准备好接收数据信息。"

#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:13 dba66dce5b3b4f5e81a558c43d37c30d
msgid ""
"The interaction between two tasks which exchanging data with each other "
"is illustrated in the following figure."
msgstr "下图展示了两个相互交换数据的任务之间的互动。"

#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:26 395883579b7c4a27a93d30d838b7498f
msgid "Serialize and Deserialize"
msgstr "序列化和反序列化"

#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:28 a2e2fb124c284d82a5af667118fa719b
msgid "The tuples are encoded in Avro format into data messages."
msgstr "元组以 Avro 格式编码成数据信息。"

#: ../../source/architecture/network.md:30 37996c8ef5364f2ea263fb18314b35ff
msgid "The tasks are encoded in JSON format."
msgstr "任务以 JSON 格式编码。"
